    "detailed_description": "\u201cDino Drink\u201d is an exciting and colorful four-player board game where each player takes on the role of a colorful T-Rex. The objective of the game is to be the first to cross the finish line, using strategy, luck and special skills to overcome your opponents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers move their T-Rex across the board, collecting skill boxes that grant them special powers. The available skills are:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Speed: Allows your T-Rex to move faster across the board.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Fireball: Gives your T-Rex the ability to launch a fireball at an opponent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Teleport: Allows your T-Rex to swap places with a random player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Traction Weapon: Allows your T-Rex to pull another player back.<br />\r\n(New skills coming with future updates)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is possible to play using physical dice and manually operate the movement of each player on the board<br />\r\nOr you can simply use the game's virtual dice.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be careful! The game also includes a drinking element. In each round,<br />\r\nthe game randomly selects a player who must drink.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cDino Drink\u201d is a fun and exciting board game that combines strategy,<br />\r\n luck and laughter. Whether you're a fan of dinosaurs, board games, or just looking for a fun new way to cheer up<br />\r\n game night, \u201cDino Drink\u201d is the game for you!",
    "about_the_game": "\u201cDino Drink\u201d is an exciting and colorful four-player board game where each player takes on the role of a colorful T-Rex. The objective of the game is to be the first to cross the finish line, using strategy, luck and special skills to overcome your opponents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers move their T-Rex across the board, collecting skill boxes that grant them special powers. The available skills are:<br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Speed: Allows your T-Rex to move faster across the board.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Fireball: Gives your T-Rex the ability to launch a fireball at an opponent.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Teleport: Allows your T-Rex to swap places with a random player.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n -Traction Weapon: Allows your T-Rex to pull another player back.<br />\r\n(New skills coming with future updates)<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIt is possible to play using physical dice and manually operate the movement of each player on the board<br />\r\nOr you can simply use the game's virtual dice.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBut be careful! The game also includes a drinking element. In each round,<br />\r\nthe game randomly selects a player who must drink.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u201cDino Drink\u201d is a fun and exciting board game that combines strategy,<br />\r\n luck and laughter. Whether you're a fan of dinosaurs, board games, or just looking for a fun new way to cheer up<br />\r\n game night, \u201cDino Drink\u201d is the game for you!",
    "short_description": "&quot;Dino Drink&quot; is a vibrant four-player board game where T-Rex characters race to the finish line, using skills like speed and fireballs. The game combines strategy and luck and includes a drinking element, making it a fun addition to game night.",
